WEBVTT

01:28.090 --> 01:35.030
Our Secret
EP12

01:37.920 --> 01:39.480
Anyway, I feel happy

01:39.649 --> 01:41.200
to stay with Ziqi, Shadi,

01:42.600 --> 01:43.649
and you.

01:45.840 --> 01:47.200
It's really great.

01:54.330 --> 01:55.649
You're nice, too.

02:32.640 --> 02:33.600
Well.

02:34.570 --> 02:37.050
Now that your direction is clear,

02:38.240 --> 02:39.330
let's start

02:39.690 --> 02:41.240
with a small goal.

02:45.600 --> 02:46.800
Let's work together!

02:49.969 --> 02:50.640
OK.

03:06.490 --> 03:07.130
Hello.

03:07.410 --> 03:09.160
Xianxian, come back quickly!

03:09.690 --> 03:10.770
There's something wrong.

03:18.240 --> 03:19.210
I don't know

03:19.210 --> 03:21.080
if your grandmother can make it through this time.

03:21.080 --> 03:22.490
I have to go back to take care of her.

03:23.160 --> 03:24.080
Congcong is still young.

03:24.360 --> 03:25.600
I can't leave him alone.

03:25.930 --> 03:27.240
Are you gonna be okay on your own?

03:28.330 --> 03:29.290
Yes, I'm OK.

03:29.719 --> 03:31.050
Mom, don't worry.

03:32.850 --> 03:34.850
Grandma will be OK.

03:36.930 --> 03:37.719
Your father

03:38.050 --> 03:39.410
teaches senior three and has to live in school.

03:39.719 --> 03:41.130
You need to take care of yourself.

03:41.690 --> 03:43.490
Don't be distracted by these things.

03:43.640 --> 03:44.440
School will begin soon.

03:44.570 --> 03:45.800
Remember to study hard.

03:46.000 --> 03:46.690
Understand?

03:47.360 --> 03:48.240
I got it.

03:51.690 --> 03:52.330
By the way,

03:53.330 --> 03:54.130
your living expenses...

03:54.290 --> 03:55.410
At the table.

03:55.800 --> 03:56.930
I will remember to take it.

03:57.410 --> 03:58.880
I should eat fruit every day.

03:59.410 --> 04:01.330
I need to text and call you.

04:01.720 --> 04:03.600
If I have anything, I can call Auntie Li.

04:03.930 --> 04:05.130
I remember it all.

04:09.440 --> 04:10.080
Jinyun

04:10.770 --> 04:11.880
I have to thank you.

04:12.290 --> 04:13.640
You're welcome.

04:14.050 --> 04:15.360
Her grandma's health is very important.

04:15.770 --> 04:16.880
Don't worry.

04:17.640 --> 04:19.570
We will take good care of Xianxian.

04:21.039 --> 04:22.130
Auntie, don't worry.

04:23.570 --> 04:24.360
Then I'll go.

04:46.799 --> 04:47.850
Here you are, Xianxian.

04:49.240 --> 04:49.890
Here.

04:55.200 --> 04:56.799
Time is limited,

04:56.799 --> 04:58.200
so I didn't prepare anything.

04:58.480 --> 05:00.290
Eat some wonton first.

05:03.920 --> 05:06.200
Xianxian, how about

05:06.200 --> 05:07.610
I tell your mother that

05:08.200 --> 05:09.240
you live here

05:09.240 --> 05:10.520
during this period.

05:13.410 --> 05:14.040
Siyue,

05:14.240 --> 05:15.040
what's your opinion?

05:18.170 --> 05:18.920
This

05:19.170 --> 05:20.760
depends on her own idea.

05:27.610 --> 05:29.040
It's okay, aunt.

05:29.610 --> 05:31.520
I can take care of myself.

05:31.970 --> 05:33.040
All right.

05:33.200 --> 05:34.850
If you have something,

05:34.850 --> 05:36.080
you can come to me.

05:36.570 --> 05:37.760
Don't be shy.

05:38.080 --> 05:39.450
Remember to come here to eat.

05:39.730 --> 05:41.080
It will be more lively with more people.

05:42.760 --> 05:43.690
Thank you, aunt.

05:44.320 --> 05:45.360
You two take your time.

05:45.360 --> 05:46.610
I'll go out to buy some fruit.

05:48.520 --> 05:49.040
Eat it.

05:50.170 --> 05:51.610
Don't forget your wallet again.

05:52.410 --> 05:53.320
Got it.

06:00.890 --> 06:01.970
I can't eat so much.

06:02.290 --> 06:03.170
You can eat more.

06:08.040 --> 06:09.200
What if

06:11.170 --> 06:12.640
my grandma...

06:14.290 --> 06:15.450
Don't talk nonsense.

06:16.570 --> 06:18.010
The best thing you should do now

06:18.450 --> 06:19.690
is to take good care of yourself.

06:20.200 --> 06:21.410
Don't let your mother worry about you.

06:21.970 --> 06:23.410
When your grandmother is recovered,

06:23.730 --> 06:25.080
you will go to see her

06:25.240 --> 06:26.760
happily and healthily.

06:27.240 --> 06:27.800
That's good.

06:31.450 --> 06:32.130
Don't worry.

06:32.730 --> 06:34.200
Your grandma will be all right.

06:37.130 --> 06:37.760
Eat quickly.

06:48.799 --> 06:49.730
Aunt,

06:49.970 --> 06:51.360
I'll go back first.

06:53.730 --> 06:54.640
Xianxian

06:54.760 --> 06:56.570
Why don't you stay for a while?

06:57.290 --> 06:58.320
I'm leaving, aunt.

06:58.320 --> 07:00.130
I've been at your house all day.

07:00.240 --> 07:01.360
It's too much trouble for you.

07:02.570 --> 07:05.010
Then you should be more careful when you live alone.

07:05.130 --> 07:06.640
Tell me if you have anything.

07:08.080 --> 07:09.800
Siyue, you go to walk Xianxian home.

07:10.170 --> 07:11.410
-Okay.  -No, no, no.

07:11.450 --> 07:12.320
It's close.

07:12.320 --> 07:13.730
I can go back by myself.

07:14.760 --> 07:15.320
All right.

07:15.890 --> 07:17.410
Then be careful on the road.

07:17.610 --> 07:18.450
Don't worry, aunt.

07:18.610 --> 07:19.040
OK.

07:19.450 --> 07:20.640
I'm leaving. Goodbye, aunt.

07:20.690 --> 07:21.130
See you later.

07:21.130 --> 07:21.890
Be careful.

07:28.610 --> 07:30.800
If my parents allow you to come to my home,

07:30.800 --> 07:31.730
it will be great.

07:32.290 --> 07:33.320
It is OK.

07:34.690 --> 07:37.080
It's the same with you calling me at night.

07:39.010 --> 07:40.799
Aren't you afraid at home alone?

07:41.040 --> 07:42.360
And in case...

07:43.080 --> 07:44.040
Don't say it.

07:44.040 --> 07:45.520
I thought it's okay,

07:45.520 --> 07:47.010
but when you say it...

07:59.010 --> 07:59.890
Shadi

08:00.760 --> 08:01.970
Don't talk.

09:26.680 --> 09:27.680
Get out of here!

09:27.880 --> 09:29.810
Someone at home!

09:29.850 --> 09:30.680
It's me!

09:35.290 --> 09:36.760
You hit me pretty hard.

09:38.610 --> 09:39.120
You...

09:40.080 --> 09:41.120
Why are you...

09:42.880 --> 09:43.760
Before your mother left,

09:43.760 --> 09:45.370
she left a spare key in my house.

09:45.930 --> 09:47.640
I knocked on the door for so long. Why don't you answer?

09:48.520 --> 09:49.730
I'm afraid.

09:49.880 --> 09:51.410
I thought it was...

09:51.930 --> 09:52.810
It's okay.

09:53.640 --> 09:54.560
The security guard just

09:54.560 --> 09:56.170
caught a thief downstairs.

09:57.000 --> 09:57.730
A thief?

09:59.930 --> 10:01.000
Look at the door.

10:02.200 --> 10:03.290
It's marked by someone.

10:12.050 --> 10:12.640
Hello.

10:14.520 --> 10:15.080
She's all right.

10:15.560 --> 10:16.250
She's next to me.

10:16.730 --> 10:17.610
You can go home first.

10:20.680 --> 10:21.810
Who?

10:22.610 --> 10:23.610
Song Ziqi

10:24.120 --> 10:25.370
Kong Shadi told him

10:25.850 --> 10:26.640
that something happened to you.

10:27.000 --> 10:28.120
They're both on their way here.

10:30.970 --> 10:32.000
It's too scary.

10:38.290 --> 10:40.370
Isn't that too much trouble for you?

10:40.610 --> 10:42.050
It doesn't matter.

10:42.250 --> 10:43.850
Don't say that.

10:45.520 --> 10:47.730
Then thank you for taking care of Xianxian.

10:47.970 --> 10:48.970
As soon as I finish my businesses,

10:48.970 --> 10:50.200
I'll be right back.

10:51.200 --> 10:52.320
Let's keep in touch.

10:52.970 --> 10:54.410
Goodbye.

11:01.000 --> 11:01.490
Here you are.

11:03.640 --> 11:04.370
Aunt,

11:05.080 --> 11:07.490
I'll trouble you for a while.

11:07.970 --> 11:09.320
You are

11:09.320 --> 11:10.730
always so sensible.

11:12.170 --> 11:13.560
It's great that you're okay.

11:14.120 --> 11:16.250
I'm still a little scared.

11:17.370 --> 11:19.050
I told you to move in.

11:21.250 --> 11:22.080
By the way, Siyue,

11:22.410 --> 11:24.410
you help Xianxian pack up

11:24.560 --> 11:25.730
and move in as soon as possible.

11:26.930 --> 11:27.810
It doesn't matter.

11:28.000 --> 11:30.290
I can pack the luggage myself.

11:34.880 --> 11:36.320
Fortunately, Xianxian is okay.

11:36.320 --> 11:37.250
It's a false alarm.

11:37.970 --> 11:38.970
I told you.

11:39.170 --> 11:41.050
They live so close.

11:41.050 --> 11:41.810
If anything happens to her,

11:41.810 --> 11:43.730
Siyue is sure to rush over at the first time.

11:44.050 --> 11:45.730
But I'm worried about her.

11:46.120 --> 11:48.200
You think everyone is as heartless as you.

11:48.970 --> 11:50.440
Fortunately, Siyue is very considerate.

11:50.970 --> 11:52.520
If something happened to me,

11:52.880 --> 11:53.810
will you come?

11:55.080 --> 11:56.320
You speak with your conscience.

11:56.680 --> 11:58.290
I've been with you every time you have an accident

11:58.290 --> 11:59.250
since you were young.

12:02.850 --> 12:03.730
It seems to be that.

12:04.880 --> 12:06.490
Remember something good about me, okay?

12:06.850 --> 12:08.640
You do more bad things than good things.

12:08.640 --> 12:09.850
How can I remember?

12:11.170 --> 12:12.170
Well, let's go.

12:12.810 --> 12:13.730
Where to go?

12:15.000 --> 12:15.930
Anyway, we're hanging out.

12:15.930 --> 12:17.760
You don't want to go home so early, do you?

12:18.320 --> 12:19.560
There is a restaurant ahead.

12:20.080 --> 12:20.810
I'll treat you to dinner.

12:22.250 --> 12:23.610
Come on. I'll treat you.

12:26.440 --> 12:28.080
I can't believe that you invite me to dinner.

12:28.080 --> 12:29.120
Did I hear you right?

12:29.320 --> 12:30.200
What's wrong?

12:31.080 --> 12:32.490
For the sake of

12:32.490 --> 12:34.410
helping me a lot,

12:34.520 --> 12:37.320
I'll give you a reward today. Let's go!

12:37.760 --> 12:39.250
Thank you, Little Princess.

13:21.290 --> 13:23.050
Today my mother told me that

13:23.050 --> 13:25.490
grandma looks much better.

13:26.080 --> 13:27.290
The doctor said

13:27.290 --> 13:29.410
she can leave the ICU soon.

13:30.930 --> 13:32.200
And...

13:33.120 --> 13:33.810
I'm moving to

13:33.810 --> 13:36.000
Zhou Siyue's home tomorrow.

13:37.080 --> 13:38.170
Is this

13:39.120 --> 13:41.320
God's arrangement?

13:43.850 --> 13:45.440
Suddenly

13:45.970 --> 13:46.520
this summer

13:46.520 --> 13:48.250
comes to an end.

14:12.200 --> 14:13.000
Good morning.

14:14.930 --> 14:15.880
Have you packed up?

14:20.200 --> 14:21.560
You just take one suitcase with you?

14:23.730 --> 14:24.880
We live so close.

14:24.880 --> 14:26.640
If I forget something, I can come back and get it.

14:32.760 --> 14:33.610
Where to go?

14:33.730 --> 14:34.810
Go shopping.

14:40.080 --> 14:41.080
This is good.

14:44.680 --> 14:46.120
This is OK, too.

14:50.680 --> 14:52.200
Get some juice.

15:00.370 --> 15:01.560
Get some instant noodles.

15:07.810 --> 15:09.370
We need to buy some shampoo.

15:11.610 --> 15:12.560
Wait a minute.

15:14.730 --> 15:16.290
Do I look like I need shampoo

15:16.290 --> 15:18.640
to prevent hair loss?

15:26.200 --> 15:27.490
I don't need it.

15:27.640 --> 15:28.810
I have a lot of hair.

15:28.850 --> 15:29.930
I'm not afraid.

15:30.520 --> 15:32.520
I don't know which one you like.

15:32.560 --> 15:34.290
We can buy a few and have a try.

15:34.290 --> 15:37.120
Let's take the most common one.

15:42.970 --> 15:44.320
We need to buy bath lotion, too.

15:46.810 --> 15:47.850
I have.

15:47.850 --> 15:49.440
I can take it.

15:50.850 --> 15:51.520
OK.

15:52.610 --> 15:54.440
You're quite diligent and thrifty.

15:54.440 --> 15:56.320
You are too extravagant and wasteful.

15:56.320 --> 15:57.290
I'll lead the way.

15:57.290 --> 15:58.760
Give it to me.

16:04.250 --> 16:05.200
I'll take it.

16:07.730 --> 16:08.610
Lead the way.

16:09.120 --> 16:11.000
Let's head for the stationery area.

16:14.080 --> 16:15.730
Here is stationery area.

16:16.120 --> 16:16.970
What do you want to buy?

16:18.080 --> 16:18.680
Take a look.

16:19.080 --> 16:20.320
This is so cute.

16:20.930 --> 16:21.970
Childish.

16:36.200 --> 16:37.410
It's fancy.

16:37.490 --> 16:38.410
It's expensive but difficult to use.

16:38.410 --> 16:40.080
When did you see me use it?

16:41.120 --> 16:42.250
This is amazing.

16:45.880 --> 16:47.520
Are you a child?

16:47.610 --> 16:49.440
My little brother doesn't even use this.

16:49.730 --> 16:50.880
What does your brother know?

16:51.440 --> 16:52.370
Come on, come on.

16:52.490 --> 16:53.320
One for each person.

16:54.000 --> 16:54.640
OK.

16:55.440 --> 16:57.370
Make up for your missing childhood.

16:57.680 --> 16:58.200
Come on, come on.

16:59.410 --> 17:00.000
What else?

17:02.410 --> 17:03.080
Ding Xian

17:03.320 --> 17:03.970
Zhou Siyue

17:05.800 --> 17:06.650
Keke

17:09.969 --> 17:10.920
Why are you two

17:11.040 --> 17:12.160
together?

17:13.560 --> 17:14.680
This is my new friend.

17:16.009 --> 17:18.160
OK. You're the boss.

17:24.890 --> 17:26.489
Why are you two together?

17:26.610 --> 17:27.080
I...

17:27.770 --> 17:31.250
Why can't we be together?

17:31.770 --> 17:32.770
Don't talk about this.

17:33.250 --> 17:35.610
I heard you play billiards very well.

17:36.610 --> 17:37.890
Find a chance to play.

17:40.040 --> 17:41.370
Can you ask something useful?

17:45.010 --> 17:45.920
What are you two doing?

17:46.770 --> 17:48.370
Don't interrupt when girls talk.

17:49.920 --> 17:51.040
What's going on with you two?

17:52.250 --> 17:53.920
Nothing.

17:54.320 --> 17:55.850
Tell me the truth.

17:59.370 --> 18:00.130
We...

18:01.440 --> 18:04.280
You and Zhou Siyue live together, right?

18:05.890 --> 18:06.890
No.

18:07.610 --> 18:09.530
You didn't tell me such a big thing.

18:09.920 --> 18:12.010
I knew it from Keke.

18:12.920 --> 18:15.280
It's not what you think.

18:15.610 --> 18:18.130
I just stay at his house for a few days.

18:19.250 --> 18:21.370
Can I come in?

18:21.730 --> 18:22.680
Auntie, come in please.

18:24.200 --> 18:26.560
Xianxian, I bring you a new towel.

18:29.400 --> 18:30.490
How's the room?

18:31.080 --> 18:32.370
Time is limited.

18:32.650 --> 18:34.440
I just arrange it briefly.

18:34.770 --> 18:36.400
Tell me if you need anything else.

18:37.440 --> 18:38.800
No, I don't need.

18:39.160 --> 18:40.970
I'm happy to see you.

18:41.250 --> 18:44.200
You're clever and sensible.

18:44.440 --> 18:45.800
I wanted a daughter

18:45.800 --> 18:47.160
like you a long time ago.

18:49.200 --> 18:50.650
I forget to collect these photos.

18:51.800 --> 18:53.650
This is a picture of Siyue when he was a child.

18:55.680 --> 18:57.490
Auntie, is this in Keshan?

18:58.530 --> 19:01.010
Yes, it is in your hometown.

19:01.890 --> 19:04.040
This is Siyue's first visit to Keshan.

19:04.320 --> 19:06.560
Unfortunately, there was a flood.

19:06.800 --> 19:09.160
His grandfather sent him to your house.

19:10.490 --> 19:12.680
After coming back, he cried all day

19:12.920 --> 19:14.770
and said he would never go to Keshan again.

19:15.650 --> 19:17.770
The flood probably frightened him.

19:19.160 --> 19:20.250
This one is interesting.

19:20.490 --> 19:23.320
This is a picture of Siyue wearing a dress as a child.

19:23.800 --> 19:24.400
This photo...

19:24.400 --> 19:25.010
Mom

19:26.970 --> 19:28.770
Why do you take out this photo again?

19:29.280 --> 19:31.040
Why are you here?

19:31.320 --> 19:33.080
I'm chatting with Xianxian.

19:33.650 --> 19:36.160
If he bothers you in the future,

19:36.400 --> 19:37.560
you can tell me.

19:37.800 --> 19:38.920
I'll help you teach him a lesson.

19:40.890 --> 19:41.400
OK.

19:42.160 --> 19:44.010
But he's nice.

19:46.320 --> 19:47.680
Take a shower later and then go to bed.

19:48.800 --> 19:50.920
Siyue, help Xianxian tidy up.

19:52.010 --> 19:52.800
Thank you, aunt.

20:01.730 --> 20:02.970
In this photo,

20:06.440 --> 20:08.130
your look is very unique.

20:13.970 --> 20:15.560
My mom always liked to

20:16.130 --> 20:17.610
dress me up during that time.

20:18.160 --> 20:19.650
Who remembers things as a child?

20:20.730 --> 20:23.080
Take a bath and sleep.

20:26.490 --> 20:27.250
Ding Xian

20:27.400 --> 20:28.440
Hey, hey, hey.

20:28.890 --> 20:30.160
Hello.

20:30.400 --> 20:31.080
Hello.

20:32.250 --> 20:33.530
You still say like this.

20:33.680 --> 20:34.770
He even asks you to take a bath.

20:34.920 --> 20:37.040
It's not what you think.

20:37.250 --> 20:37.770
Come on.

20:38.080 --> 20:39.490
You are not allowed to be absent

20:39.490 --> 20:40.800
at the girls' group meeting tomorrow. Bye.

20:59.650 --> 21:01.160
Why don't you lock the door?

21:03.770 --> 21:04.400
Go on.

21:06.530 --> 21:07.850
Where is the hair dryer?

21:13.280 --> 21:13.850
Mom

21:15.200 --> 21:16.400
Where is the hair dryer?

21:17.440 --> 21:19.160
The hair dryer is

21:19.440 --> 21:21.650
in the cupboard under the sink.

21:22.130 --> 21:23.320
Look for it carefully.

21:57.610 --> 21:58.490
Ding Xian

22:00.280 --> 22:01.370
We're going to be late.

22:06.850 --> 22:07.920
Still asleep.

22:14.370 --> 22:18.080
The second set of national broadcast gymnastics for middle school students,

22:18.400 --> 22:20.530
the Time Is Calling.

22:26.280 --> 22:27.320
Get ready.

22:32.850 --> 22:34.560
Zhou Siyue, are you crazy?

22:35.040 --> 22:35.530
Hurry up.

22:49.280 --> 22:50.970
Why do you ride your bike today?

22:51.770 --> 22:53.010
You're too slow.

22:53.200 --> 22:54.400
I don't want to be late.

22:54.890 --> 22:56.440
I didn't beg you to wait for me.

22:56.440 --> 22:58.010
If you are in a hurry, you can go first.

22:58.920 --> 23:00.320
I spoil you too much.

23:02.650 --> 23:04.080
If you don't want to be late,

23:04.440 --> 23:05.440
you can beg me to give you a ride.

23:06.770 --> 23:07.650
I don't need.

23:08.280 --> 23:09.250
Lazy bug.

23:10.770 --> 23:11.850
Childish.

23:29.970 --> 23:31.200
Good morning, Shadi.

23:31.530 --> 23:32.250
Good morning.

23:33.800 --> 23:34.800
I've seen this.

23:35.890 --> 23:39.160
How about living next door to Prince Charming?

23:40.320 --> 23:41.890
Put those two words away.

23:42.040 --> 23:43.010
He...

23:43.250 --> 23:45.160
He's simply not in his right mind.

23:45.610 --> 23:47.920
You don't appreciate the happy life you enjoy .

23:48.010 --> 23:49.610
You have to tell me everything today.

23:51.530 --> 23:53.160
Living under the same roof

23:53.250 --> 23:55.130
is really not what you think.

23:55.770 --> 23:56.610
Imagine that

23:56.920 --> 23:58.280
you and Song Ziqi

23:58.280 --> 24:00.440
meet every day.

24:02.250 --> 24:03.160
Are you happy?

24:04.130 --> 24:05.080
By the way,

24:06.160 --> 24:07.530
I lived with him for a while

24:07.530 --> 24:08.850
when I was a small kid.

24:09.200 --> 24:10.370
Tell me the story.

24:10.680 --> 24:11.370
I tell you.

24:12.400 --> 24:13.560
Song Ziqi always loved to run away from home

24:13.560 --> 24:15.280
when he was young.

24:15.490 --> 24:16.280
At that time,

24:16.280 --> 24:18.010
the relationship between our two families was good.

24:18.160 --> 24:19.770
He always loved coming to live with me.

24:19.800 --> 24:20.920
He slept on the floor in my room.

24:21.370 --> 24:22.200
He snores,

24:22.730 --> 24:24.800
grinds his teeth and farts

24:25.130 --> 24:26.200
when he sleeps.

24:26.850 --> 24:28.250
This is not the most tiresome thing.

24:28.440 --> 24:30.130
Do you know what it is?

24:30.200 --> 24:30.890
What?

24:31.010 --> 24:32.970
Every time

24:33.280 --> 24:34.920
I got up from a nap,

24:35.370 --> 24:36.890
he was lying on the bed

24:37.160 --> 24:38.770
and I was lying on the ground.

24:40.400 --> 24:41.730
How could he do that?

24:42.850 --> 24:43.650
It seems

24:44.250 --> 24:46.610
I'm still quite comfortable.

25:14.770 --> 25:15.400
Thank you.

25:19.970 --> 25:20.920
And then?

25:21.610 --> 25:22.530
You didn't

25:23.040 --> 25:24.400
say anything else at night?

25:26.370 --> 25:27.400
About what?

25:28.320 --> 25:29.320
I'm so tired.

25:30.560 --> 25:31.490
It's boring.

25:31.680 --> 25:32.320
Boring?

25:33.770 --> 25:34.920
Think about it.

25:35.400 --> 25:37.370
Isn't this Full House?

25:38.130 --> 25:40.370
There is a long way to go.

25:41.560 --> 25:43.920
Stop watching so many idol dramas.

25:44.560 --> 25:45.610
Instead, I think

25:46.040 --> 25:47.040
the closer the distance is,

25:47.440 --> 25:48.400
the easier it is to be disillusioned.

25:48.730 --> 25:49.680
You get it.

25:50.080 --> 25:51.890
It seems that you lived with others.

25:51.890 --> 25:52.440
You...

25:54.080 --> 25:54.890
Then you say.

25:58.560 --> 26:00.650
I don't know how to say it.

26:01.250 --> 26:02.130
Anyway,

26:03.040 --> 26:04.680
I'm quite happy.

26:06.680 --> 26:08.530
A fickle woman!

26:20.650 --> 26:21.560
Childe,

26:22.560 --> 26:23.370
how's it going?

26:24.560 --> 26:26.440
You and Ding Xian live in the same room.

26:29.800 --> 26:31.200
You're talking nonsense.

26:31.610 --> 26:33.400
In the same room?

26:33.800 --> 26:34.730
Am I wrong?

26:35.800 --> 26:37.010
Anyway, Little Monster

26:37.680 --> 26:39.040
is also a beautiful woman

26:39.040 --> 26:40.320
with beautiful eyebrows and clear eyes.

26:41.280 --> 26:42.130
She is a girl.

26:42.400 --> 26:44.560
What about me? Why should I take him in?

26:44.680 --> 26:45.320
A boy.

26:45.400 --> 26:46.890
I have to pay for his family dispute.

26:48.800 --> 26:49.800
What's the matter?

26:50.680 --> 26:51.770
You both look at me like this.

26:53.320 --> 26:54.280
When do you plan to go back

26:54.370 --> 26:55.800
this time?

26:57.370 --> 26:58.160
In my opinion,

26:58.320 --> 26:59.490
your dad is too cruel this time.

27:00.160 --> 27:01.530
It's not the first time he has done this.

27:02.560 --> 27:05.560
But it's longer than before, isn't it?

27:06.970 --> 27:07.850
Even if

27:08.440 --> 27:10.650
your father is angry,

27:11.040 --> 27:12.160
I think your mother

27:12.160 --> 27:13.680
will be worried about you.

27:22.490 --> 27:23.730
Let's play games.

27:35.160 --> 27:36.440
My mother goes to play cards.

27:37.010 --> 27:37.850
Make do with it.

27:46.920 --> 27:48.200
Do you usually

27:48.320 --> 27:50.160
eat alone?

27:52.610 --> 27:53.770
But now

27:54.080 --> 27:55.440
I have one more person to eat together.

27:55.680 --> 27:56.560
It's quite lively.

27:57.560 --> 27:58.130
Not bad.

27:58.680 --> 28:01.130
Really? Then you should cherish me.

28:02.890 --> 28:03.650
I'm not afraid.

28:04.200 --> 28:05.530
I'll go to your home

28:05.530 --> 28:06.320
and eat there every day.

28:06.560 --> 28:07.490
Keep dreaming.

28:14.320 --> 28:15.250
It's a little salty.

28:17.010 --> 28:19.040
My mom doesn't cook usually.

28:19.560 --> 28:20.440
Otherwise,

28:21.080 --> 28:22.370
I'll take you out to eat.

28:23.650 --> 28:25.920
No, I think it's delicious.

28:26.320 --> 28:28.850
And it's comfortable to eat home-cooked food.

28:31.650 --> 28:32.400
OK, you wash the dishes

28:33.610 --> 28:34.730
after eating.

28:38.490 --> 28:40.800
I often help you make up lessons for free.

28:41.160 --> 28:42.400
You need to make up to me.

28:45.280 --> 28:45.920
All right.

28:46.200 --> 28:47.560
Childe, I will wash.

29:03.650 --> 29:04.850
You also prepared some fruit.

29:09.440 --> 29:11.490
Can I watch TV?

29:12.280 --> 29:13.200
Sure.

29:16.610 --> 29:18.280
Where is the remote control?

29:23.200 --> 29:24.370
Did you hide it?

29:25.970 --> 29:27.800
How can I hide the remote control?

29:31.440 --> 29:32.320
No.

29:33.280 --> 29:34.530
You get up and let me have a look.

29:34.730 --> 29:36.400
I didn't hide it. Don't touch me.

29:37.850 --> 29:39.320
I saw it. You just hid it.

29:39.320 --> 29:39.920
Here.

29:40.280 --> 29:41.160
You're still quibbling.

29:42.650 --> 29:43.770
Have you finished your homework?

29:43.770 --> 29:44.490
You just want to watch TV.

29:45.040 --> 29:46.250
I have finished.

29:46.320 --> 29:47.530
Let me have a look.

29:48.730 --> 29:49.530
OK.

29:53.280 --> 29:55.200
If you can grab it, I will let you watch TV.

30:00.370 --> 30:01.080
Zhou Siyue

30:02.160 --> 30:03.160
Don't push me.

30:04.400 --> 30:05.440
What's up?

30:11.250 --> 30:12.160
My brother and I

30:12.160 --> 30:13.160
robbed the remote control at home

30:13.160 --> 30:13.970
for so many years.

30:18.400 --> 30:20.080
You're a little rude.

30:20.370 --> 30:22.920
Because you usually watch TV in a comfortable environment.

30:30.970 --> 30:32.280
Look at you.

30:32.440 --> 30:34.320
You're like my brother who couldn't grab the remote control.

30:34.320 --> 30:35.370
As like as two peas.

30:52.040 --> 30:53.440
Did you use the website

30:53.850 --> 30:54.610
I gave you last time?

30:54.730 --> 30:55.370
Yes.

30:57.680 --> 30:58.970
I quite like it.

30:59.770 --> 31:00.490
Thank you.

31:03.530 --> 31:04.400
I'm glad you enjoy it.

31:05.200 --> 31:06.040
It's worth

31:06.400 --> 31:07.730
my effort.

31:09.680 --> 31:11.080
If you want to use a computer,

31:11.280 --> 31:12.160
you can use mine.

31:12.530 --> 31:13.400
The password is six zeros.

31:15.010 --> 31:15.650
Really?

31:18.080 --> 31:18.970
Here's the remote control.

31:19.370 --> 31:20.530
Then I'll borrow your computer.

31:22.850 --> 31:23.730
Don't play too late.

31:23.730 --> 31:24.920
We have to get up early tomorrow.

31:25.200 --> 31:26.040
Got it.

31:39.650 --> 31:40.770
I asked you to go to bed early.

31:41.440 --> 31:42.850
Look, you're going to sleep again

31:43.040 --> 31:43.920
in class today.

31:44.490 --> 31:45.770
I had gone to bed early.

31:46.080 --> 31:48.130
I was playing cards with Zheng's wife this afternoon.

31:48.200 --> 31:49.400
She said Zheng stays at home

31:49.400 --> 31:50.920
and helped his son with his lessons.

31:51.250 --> 31:53.130
Zhou Zongtang, you lied to me.

31:53.130 --> 31:54.530
Would you please stop crying?

31:54.970 --> 31:56.280
The children will be back soon.

31:56.680 --> 31:57.650
I told you many time

31:57.650 --> 31:58.610
but you don't believe me.

31:58.610 --> 32:00.040
Zheng was there at that time.

32:00.040 --> 32:01.610
He answered a phone and left.

32:01.800 --> 32:02.920
Jiang stayed with me all the way.

32:02.920 --> 32:03.560
You can ask him.

32:03.650 --> 32:04.610
You think I don't know.

32:04.920 --> 32:06.160
Jiang is your friend.

32:06.250 --> 32:07.250
He lied for you.

32:08.200 --> 32:09.440
I wouldn't believe him.

32:09.920 --> 32:12.560
Zhou Zongtang, tell me the truth.

32:12.920 --> 32:14.610
Are you cheating me?

32:14.610 --> 32:15.530
What are you talking about?

32:15.770 --> 32:16.920
I can't talk with you.

32:22.800 --> 32:23.650
Xianxian, you are here.

32:24.730 --> 32:26.250
Why don't you say hello when you go home?

32:27.010 --> 32:29.400
Didn't you tell me when you came back?

32:30.610 --> 32:32.680
Haven't you eaten? Yun

32:33.040 --> 32:33.850
The children are back.

32:34.080 --> 32:34.850
I'm going to cook.

32:43.010 --> 32:44.610
You are back.

32:45.320 --> 32:46.610
I'll help your dad.

33:13.610 --> 33:14.250
Come in.

33:31.250 --> 33:32.280
Do you have questions?

33:33.370 --> 33:34.680
I'll teach you when I finish this.

33:35.160 --> 33:36.770
No. You can go on.

33:38.650 --> 33:40.680
Aren't you preparing for the National Olympiads?

33:41.130 --> 33:42.400
I come to see you.

33:47.850 --> 33:48.680
The room is a bit messy.

33:50.250 --> 33:50.770
Sit down.

34:09.010 --> 34:11.010
Have you read all these books?

34:19.730 --> 34:21.330
I want to tell you

34:21.730 --> 34:23.400
I won't tell others what I heard

34:23.400 --> 34:24.120
this afternoon.

34:24.330 --> 34:24.879
I promise.

34:25.200 --> 34:25.879
I swear.

34:29.730 --> 34:31.440
How can a couple not quarrel?

34:32.680 --> 34:34.290
Don't be too sad.

34:40.440 --> 34:41.010
What's the matter?

34:42.250 --> 34:43.600
You find my home

34:43.839 --> 34:45.920
is not as harmonious as you think.

34:46.680 --> 34:47.970
Are you psychologically balanced?

34:49.049 --> 34:49.879
No.

34:50.529 --> 34:51.160
No?

34:56.200 --> 34:57.120
Maybe

34:57.569 --> 34:59.290
a little.

35:02.840 --> 35:04.330
But I didn't gloat.

35:08.290 --> 35:09.090
It's okay.

35:12.360 --> 35:13.330
My mother

35:14.490 --> 35:15.840
doesn't have a job,

35:16.250 --> 35:18.330
so her focus is on my dad.

35:19.730 --> 35:21.360
You know my dad. He's busy at work.

35:21.640 --> 35:23.200
He doesn't have much time for my mother.

35:24.200 --> 35:26.440
So my mother is always paranoid.

35:26.770 --> 35:27.880
She listens to rumors.

35:28.770 --> 35:29.840
I'm used to it.

35:36.050 --> 35:37.200
And look at my mom.

35:38.680 --> 35:40.530
She grew up in a honeypot since she was a child,

35:41.290 --> 35:42.440
so she thought

35:42.640 --> 35:44.360
everyone around her would be good for her.

35:44.920 --> 35:46.440
She's not the sort of person to bear a grudge.

35:47.490 --> 35:48.490
She may forget

35:50.360 --> 35:52.120
many things in two or three days.

35:54.770 --> 35:56.600
But I remember

35:57.160 --> 35:58.330
all the grievances

35:59.490 --> 36:00.730
my mother suffered.

36:08.050 --> 36:08.600
What's up?

36:10.400 --> 36:11.640
Do you find that

36:11.640 --> 36:13.090
I'm not as good as I usually look?

36:15.770 --> 36:16.640
No.

36:16.680 --> 36:17.570
Of course not.

36:20.010 --> 36:21.050
Don't lie to me.

36:25.880 --> 36:27.120
I think you are very good.

36:31.640 --> 36:33.360
We're both seventeen.

36:34.330 --> 36:36.970
There will definitely be a lot of troubles and confusion.

36:39.490 --> 36:41.360
But no one is perfect.

36:43.330 --> 36:46.010
Don't put so much pressure on yourself.

36:55.640 --> 36:56.970
I'm not like my dad.

36:58.600 --> 37:01.050
I won't let the people around me be wronged.

37:16.050 --> 37:16.810
Drink it.

37:18.090 --> 37:19.160
Have a good sleep after drinking.

37:43.730 --> 37:44.120
When

37:44.120 --> 37:46.160
Shadi and Keke asked me,

37:46.880 --> 37:48.440
I didn't know the answer.

37:49.600 --> 37:50.840
But I think

37:52.010 --> 37:53.440
there may be

37:53.440 --> 37:54.360
neither fantasy

37:54.400 --> 37:55.530
nor disillusionment for me.

37:56.730 --> 37:58.640
Sometimes, he is very considerate.

37:59.090 --> 38:00.970
Sometimes, he's annoying.

38:02.680 --> 38:04.840
Sometimes, he's fragile.

38:05.330 --> 38:06.730
But all this

38:06.730 --> 38:08.090
only makes me happy.

38:08.970 --> 38:10.490
Because at the moment,

38:10.970 --> 38:11.880
he really

38:11.880 --> 38:13.490
exists in my heart

38:14.490 --> 38:15.730
and will not disappear

38:16.640 --> 38:17.880
in front of me.

38:25.200 --> 38:26.090
What are you laughing at?

38:27.010 --> 38:28.200
I feel like

38:28.490 --> 38:31.120
we've been getting along well lately.

38:31.680 --> 38:34.290
And I know a lot of his secrets.

38:34.840 --> 38:35.770
What are the secrets?

38:36.050 --> 38:37.160
Tell me.

38:37.840 --> 38:38.680
No way.

38:38.880 --> 38:41.200
I promised him to keep the secrets.

38:41.640 --> 38:42.600
It's boring.

38:43.840 --> 38:45.120
But I can't imagine that

38:45.640 --> 38:47.880
you can get something on Zhou Siyue.

38:48.160 --> 38:50.330
He has been excellent since childhood.

38:59.600 --> 39:01.400
Have you heard about He Xingwen's family?

39:05.490 --> 39:07.600
His father seems to have had an accident on the construction site.

39:17.730 --> 39:18.400
Stand up.

39:20.730 --> 39:23.570
Hello, teacher.

39:23.730 --> 39:24.360
Sit down please.

39:29.810 --> 39:31.920
Some people may have heard about

39:32.680 --> 39:34.810
what happened to He Xingwen's family.

39:35.290 --> 39:37.010
Although it is a voluntary contribution,

39:37.730 --> 39:40.490
I still hope everyone can lend a helping hand

39:40.840 --> 39:41.970
to help He Xingwen

39:42.400 --> 39:43.290
and his family

39:43.400 --> 39:44.730
get through the difficulties.

39:57.920 --> 39:59.530
He looks really pathetic.

40:00.530 --> 40:02.090
But I was angry

40:02.090 --> 40:02.970
when I thought of what he had done before.

40:03.530 --> 40:05.090
He's so mean.

40:05.400 --> 40:07.090
I feel like

40:07.810 --> 40:08.810
I'm helping the bad guys.

40:09.570 --> 40:10.570
You're stupid.

40:10.730 --> 40:12.250
Your expression is not suitable.

40:13.160 --> 40:14.120
I don't like him.

40:14.730 --> 40:16.810
But this is a different thing.

40:16.920 --> 40:18.250
You should help if you have the ability.

40:18.880 --> 40:19.880
But I'm still angry.

40:20.250 --> 40:21.440
He reported Ding Xian before.

40:21.970 --> 40:23.570
And the last time we were punished because of chatting.

40:23.640 --> 40:24.490
He is to blame for these.

40:25.160 --> 40:26.010
Maybe

40:26.250 --> 40:28.010
he also did the thing about Siyue last time.

40:28.970 --> 40:31.010
You're right. He did it.

40:32.090 --> 40:34.120
We all know that Auntie talked to him later.

40:36.730 --> 40:37.920
You know it all.

40:38.840 --> 40:39.880
It doesn't matter.

40:40.360 --> 40:41.970
Anyway, the money is not for him.

40:42.200 --> 40:43.530
It's for his grandparents.

40:44.250 --> 40:45.970
Two old people have just lost their son.

40:46.010 --> 40:47.570
It would be sad for them

40:47.880 --> 40:48.810
to find that their grandson is not living well.

41:07.970 --> 41:09.640
You donated all your pocket money.

41:11.360 --> 41:12.570
Do my best.

41:13.160 --> 41:15.570
If the same thing happened to me one day,

41:16.010 --> 41:18.160
I should also hope that everyone can help me.

41:30.730 --> 41:31.570
So much.

41:32.330 --> 41:33.680
It's the same.

41:34.330 --> 41:35.640
It is a token of my affection.

41:37.010 --> 41:37.570
Let's go.

41:43.290 --> 41:43.970
Thank you.

41:46.250 --> 41:46.920
And

41:48.400 --> 41:49.120
I'm sorry.

42:05.050 --> 42:05.810
Look at this.

42:06.810 --> 42:07.970
If you can't solve it,

42:07.970 --> 42:09.400
just ask me directly.

42:10.490 --> 42:12.600
Don't split hairs all day.

42:13.250 --> 42:14.200
There will be more mistakes.

42:15.680 --> 42:17.730
I can't rely on you all the time.

42:18.160 --> 42:19.600
I have to work hard on my own.

42:23.010 --> 42:23.600
Good.

42:24.160 --> 42:25.050
Your idea is good.

42:26.530 --> 42:27.770
I'm satisfied with you.

42:32.200 --> 42:32.730
By the way,

42:33.490 --> 42:35.440
can you go to Huaqing University directly

42:36.360 --> 42:38.570
after the National Olympiads?

42:41.090 --> 42:42.360
This time

42:43.120 --> 42:44.770
if I win the first prize

42:45.490 --> 42:48.360
and plus some other awards,

42:49.120 --> 42:50.090
it should be OK.

42:55.640 --> 42:56.200
What's the matter?

42:56.730 --> 42:57.400
No.

42:58.680 --> 43:00.840
I envy you very much.

43:01.640 --> 43:03.570
If you go to Huaqing University,

43:03.770 --> 43:05.970
you can go to Jiangling with your father.

43:07.600 --> 43:09.440
Jiangling is big and prosperous.

43:11.680 --> 43:12.840
I'd like to see it, too.

43:17.530 --> 43:18.200
Ding Xian

43:19.050 --> 43:20.090
How about

43:28.360 --> 43:29.600
you come to Jiangling with me?
